{%- comment -%}
  Product card — the quick-view disc.

  A real link to the piece, which `theme.js` upgrades into the overlay. Without
  scripting it lands on the product page: the same information, one navigation
  further away.

  **Its presence is the switch.** `snippets/product-card.liquid` renders the
  disc only when `settings.quick_view_enabled` is on; here the merchant adds or
  removes the block, which is what a block is for. The theme setting still
  governs whether the overlay is rendered into the header at all — with it off
  this disc is simply a link to the product page, which is the same thing it
  degrades to for a visitor without scripting.

  **It sits in the `media` grid row rather than inside the photograph.** The
  disc is `position: absolute` against the card, and `.card--composed` pins the
  photograph to the first row, so "the top-right corner of the card" and "the
  top-right corner of the photograph" are the same place. That is what lets the
  disc and the photograph be siblings either of which can be removed on its
  own — the arrows could not be split out the same way, because they centre
  themselves on their containing block and would land over the caption.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product = closest.product
  assign quick_view_label = 'products.quick_view_of' | t: title: product.title
-%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  <a
    class="card__quick"
    href="{{ product.url }}"
    data-quick-view
    data-tip="{{ 'products.quick_view' | t }}"
    aria-label="{{ quick_view_label }}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M2.5 12S6 6.5 12 6.5 21.5 12 21.5 12 18 17.5 12 17.5 2.5 12 2.5 12z" />
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6" />
    </svg>
  </a>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.product_card_quick_view.name",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:blocks.product_card_quick_view.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
